# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Image Sorter Backend - Environment Configuration
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Server Configuration
PORT=3000
NODE_ENV=development

# Upload Configuration
MAX_FILE_SIZE=10485760
MAX_FILE_COUNT=50

# Allowed file types
ALLOWED_EXTENSIONS=.jpg,.jpeg,.png,.webp

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# AI Page Detection Configuration
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# The system uses AI to detect page numbers in document images.
# Two options are available (in priority order):
#
#   1. Google Document AI Layout Parser (recommended for production)
#   2. Google Gemini Vision API (free tier, good for development)
#
# If neither is configured, falls back to OCR-only mode.

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTION 1: Google Document AI Layout Parser (PRIMARY)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Best accuracy for extracting page numbers from document layouts.
# Requires Google Cloud Platform setup:
#
#   1. Create a GCP project
#   2. Enable the Document AI API
#   3. Create a "Layout Parser" processor in Document AI
#   4. Create a service account and download the key file
#   5. Set GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS to the key file path
#
# GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT=your-project-id
# DOCUMENT_AI_PROCESSOR_ID=your-processor-id
# DOCUMENT_AI_LOCATION=us

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# OPTION 2: Google Gemini Vision API (FALLBACK)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Free tier available, good for development and smaller workloads.
# Get your API key from: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
GEMINI_API_KEY=your-gemini-api-key
GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash

# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Sorting Rules
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# The sorting system follows these strict rules:
#
#   1. Sort pages by detected page numbers in ASCENDING order
#   2. Do NOT fill missing page numbers (e.g., 1,2,3,8,9 stays as-is)
#   3. Missing pages (like 4,5,6,7) are IGNORED, not inferred
#   4. Pages without detectable page numbers are placed using content analysis
#
# Output includes:
#   - Sorted pages
#   - Detected page number (or null if missing)
#   - Stable and logical ordering
